Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:33.02,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,120,255,0,300,2000,5000)\pos(145,275)\frz-90\1c&Hbea0ce&}究竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:18.39,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(220,80,255,0,0,800,5200)\1c&HFFAAFF&}十二月十七日  星期三
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:22.76,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\pos(350,180)\frz-90\1c&HFFAAFF&}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.79,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\pos(350,180)\frz-90\1c&HFFAAFF&}由绮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.85,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这里和后面一段画面上的字都是「对不起」
